# Text files are kept with LF line endings, in the repository and in every checkout, on every system. An editor that
# saves CRLF does no harm: Git turns it back into LF when the file is added. Without this, a file saved with other
# line endings showed up in a diff as rewritten from the first line to the last.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.xpi binary
